e it was your own teammate you just took out.", "timestamp_created": 1711233667, "timestamp_updated": 1711233667, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "161298985", "author": {"steamid": "76561198881869905", "personaname": "Mario", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198881869905/", "num_games_owned": 33, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 3361, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3040, "last_played": 1719062206, "avatar": "8442685651231b08503c282a75c5f324df2ae085"}, "language": "english", "review": "Game is great and all but you have to actively take precautions to avoid crashing the game, literally my earphones running out of battery crashed the game and ruined my mission, tabbing out causes the game to crash way too often. If you dont have the patience to deal with so many crashes and learn how to avoid them then do not get the game.", "timestamp_created": 1711233128, "timestamp_updated": 1711233128, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1378969200", "reactions": []}]}